<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Multicanal affirmed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Multicanal affirmed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it was maintaining its outperform rating on Brazil's Multicanal and its year-end target price of $17 per ADS.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Multicanal's 1996 results came ahead of our projections, reaching consolidated EBITDA of $41.1 million, versus our estimate of $35.6 million,&quot; said analyst Luiz Carvalho in a report.</p>
<p>-- It said results were helped by stronger-than-expected net revenues, which reached $204.4 million versus estimates of $179.6 million.</p>
</text>
